[
  {
    "segment": 1,
    "chapter": 1,
    "text": "AI 几秒钟就能解释“善假于物”。",
    "start": 3.365,
    "end": 6.534999999999999,
    "style": "Narration"
  },
  {
    "segment": 1,
    "chapter": 1,
    "text": "可看懂了解释，",
    "start": 6.56,
    "end": 7.9399999999999995,
    "style": "Narration"
  },
  {
    "segment": 1,
    "chapter": 1,
    "text": "我又冒出一个问题：",
    "start": 7.965,
    "end": 8.645,
    "style": "Narration"
  },
  {
    "segment": 2,
    "chapter": 1,
    "text": "工具能帮我做到越来越多，",
    "start": 10.525,
    "end": 12.985,
    "style": "Narration"
  },
  {
    "segment": 2,
    "chapter": 1,
    "text": "那我自己，还要学什么？",
    "start": 13.175,
    "end": 15.015,
    "style": "Narration"
  },
  {
    "segment": 3,
    "chapter": 2,
    "text": "君子曰：学不可以已。",
    "start": 16.805,
    "end": 20.015,
    "style": "Quote"
  },
  {
    "segment": 4,
    "chapter": 2,
    "text": "青，取之于蓝，而青于蓝；",
    "start": 21.215,
    "end": 25.075,
    "style": "Quote"
  },
  {
    "segment": 4,
    "chapter": 2,
    "text": "冰，水为之，而寒于水。",
    "start": 25.61,
    "end": 28.985,
    "style": "Quote"
  },
  {
    "segment": 5,
    "chapter": 2,
    "text": "青出于蓝，水凝成冰。",
    "start": 30.225,
    "end": 33.535,
    "style": "Narration"
  },
  {
    "segment": 5,
    "chapter": 2,
    "text": "学习，也应该让我发生变化。",
    "start": 34.06,
    "end": 36.685,
    "style": "Narration"
  },
  {
    "segment": 6,
    "chapter": 2,
    "text": "我想试试：暂时不看屏幕，",
    "start": 37.965,
    "end": 40.885,
    "style": "Narration"
  },
  {
    "segment": 6,
    "chapter": 2,
    "text": "能不能把这句话讲清楚，",
    "start": 40.94,
    "end": 42.865,
    "style": "Narration"
  },
  {
    "segment": 6,
    "chapter": 2,
    "text": "再举一个自己的例子。",
    "start": 43.145,
    "end": 44.425,
    "style": "Narration"
  },
  {
    "segment": 7,
    "chapter": 3,
    "text": "吾尝终日而思矣，",
    "start": 46.535,
    "end": 48.955,
    "style": "Quote"
  },
  {
    "segment": 7,
    "chapter": 3,
    "text": "不如须臾之所学也；",
    "start": 49.035,
    "end": 51.615,
    "style": "Quote"
  },
  {
    "segment": 7,
    "chapter": 3,
    "text": "吾尝跂而望矣，",
    "start": 52.17,
    "end": 54.085,
    "style": "Quote"
  },
  {
    "segment": 7,
    "chapter": 3,
    "text": "不如登高之博见也。",
    "start": 54.175,
    "end": 56.565,
    "style": "Quote"
  },
  {
    "segment": 8,
    "chapter": 3,
    "text": "登高而招，臂非加长也，",
    "start": 57.775,
    "end": 60.74,
    "style": "Quote"
  },
  {
    "segment": 8,
    "chapter": 3,
    "text": "而见者远；",
    "start": 60.765,
    "end": 61.915,
    "style": "Quote"
  },
  {
    "segment": 8,
    "chapter": 3,
    "text": "顺风而呼，声非加疾也，",
    "start": 62.44,
    "end": 65.38,
    "style": "Quote"
  },
  {
    "segment": 8,
    "chapter": 3,
    "text": "而闻者彰。",
    "start": 65.405,
    "end": 66.675,
    "style": "Quote"
  },
  {
    "segment": 9,
    "chapter": 3,
    "text": "登高，让我看见原来看不见的地方。",
    "start": 67.995,
    "end": 71.345,
    "style": "Narration"
  },
  {
    "segment": 9,
    "chapter": 3,
    "text": "AI 也能帮我找资料、换个角度。",
    "start": 71.835,
    "end": 74.255,
    "style": "Narration"
  },
  {
    "segment": 10,
    "chapter": 3,
    "text": "省下来的时间，",
    "start": 75.215,
    "end": 76.605,
    "style": "Narration"
  },
  {
    "segment": 10,
    "chapter": 3,
    "text": "我可以用来读原文、比较解释，",
    "start": 76.635,
    "end": 79.575,
    "style": "Narration"
  },
  {
    "segment": 10,
    "chapter": 3,
    "text": "把没想通的地方接着想。",
    "start": 79.675,
    "end": 81.555,
    "style": "Narration"
  },
  {
    "segment": 11,
    "chapter": 4,
    "text": "假舆马者，非利足也，",
    "start": 82.775,
    "end": 85.765,
    "style": "Quote"
  },
  {
    "segment": 11,
    "chapter": 4,
    "text": "而致千里；",
    "start": 85.825,
    "end": 87.295,
    "style": "Quote"
  },
  {
    "segment": 11,
    "chapter": 4,
    "text": "假舟楫者，非能水也，",
    "start": 87.63,
    "end": 90.385,
    "style": "Quote"
  },
  {
    "segment": 11,
    "chapter": 4,
    "text": "而绝江河。",
    "start": 90.485,
    "end": 92.175,
    "style": "Quote"
  },
  {
    "segment": 12,
    "chapter": 4,
    "text": "君子生非异也，",
    "start": 93.105,
    "end": 95.495,
    "style": "Quote"
  },
  {
    "segment": 12,
    "chapter": 4,
    "text": "善假于物也。",
    "start": 95.585,
    "end": 97.775,
    "style": "Quote"
  },
  {
    "segment": 13,
    "chapter": 4,
    "text": "舟能帮我渡河，",
    "start": 99.125,
    "end": 100.805,
    "style": "Narration"
  },
  {
    "segment": 13,
    "chapter": 4,
    "text": "可桨怎样划，还得看水流。",
    "start": 100.925,
    "end": 103.915,
    "style": "Narration"
  },
  {
    "segment": 14,
    "chapter": 4,
    "text": "看一看，调一调，",
    "start": 104.635,
    "end": 106.21,
    "style": "Narration"
  },
  {
    "segment": 14,
    "chapter": 4,
    "text": "才能朝想去的地方走。",
    "start": 106.235,
    "end": 108.155,
    "style": "Narration"
  },
  {
    "segment": 14,
    "chapter": 4,
    "text": "原来，用好工具，",
    "start": 108.525,
    "end": 110.08999999999999,
    "style": "Narration"
  },
  {
    "segment": 14,
    "chapter": 4,
    "text": "本身也需要学习。",
    "start": 110.115,
    "end": 111.095,
    "style": "Narration"
  },
  {
    "segment": 15,
    "chapter": 5,
    "text": "积土成山，风雨兴焉；",
    "start": 112.965,
    "end": 116.345,
    "style": "Quote"
  },
  {
    "segment": 15,
    "chapter": 5,
    "text": "积水成渊，蛟龙生焉。",
    "start": 116.86,
    "end": 119.835,
    "style": "Quote"
  },
  {
    "segment": 16,
    "chapter": 5,
    "text": "故不积跬步，无以至千里；",
    "start": 120.955,
    "end": 124.045,
    "style": "Quote"
  },
  {
    "segment": 16,
    "chapter": 5,
    "text": "不积小流，无以成江海。",
    "start": 124.36,
    "end": 127.065,
    "style": "Quote"
  },
  {
    "segment": 17,
    "chapter": 5,
    "text": "我在纸上写下：",
    "start": 128.345,
    "end": 129.625,
    "style": "Narration"
  },
  {
    "segment": 17,
    "chapter": 5,
    "text": "“借助工具，能让人做到更多。”",
    "start": 129.845,
    "end": 132.355,
    "style": "Narration"
  },
  {
    "segment": 18,
    "chapter": 5,
    "text": "又添上一句：“借助工具，",
    "start": 133.545,
    "end": 135.98999999999998,
    "style": "Narration"
  },
  {
    "segment": 18,
    "chapter": 5,
    "text": "也要把原来不会的东西学会。”",
    "start": 136.015,
    "end": 137.995,
    "style": "Narration"
  },
  {
    "segment": 19,
    "chapter": 5,
    "text": "写到这里，我对“学不可以已”，",
    "start": 138.975,
    "end": 142.22,
    "style": "Narration"
  },
  {
    "segment": 19,
    "chapter": 5,
    "text": "有了新的理解。",
    "start": 142.245,
    "end": 143.295,
    "style": "Narration"
  },
  {
    "segment": 20,
    "chapter": 6,
    "text": "我又读了一遍：",
    "start": 144.665,
    "end": 145.905,
    "style": "Narration"
  },
  {
    "segment": 20,
    "chapter": 6,
    "text": "“君子生非异也，",
    "start": 146.325,
    "end": 148.295,
    "style": "Narration"
  },
  {
    "segment": 20,
    "chapter": 6,
    "text": "善假于物也。”",
    "start": 148.385,
    "end": 149.825,
    "style": "Narration"
  },
  {
    "segment": 21,
    "chapter": 6,
    "text": "这句话让我想到：",
    "start": 151.035,
    "end": 152.655,
    "style": "Narration"
  },
  {
    "segment": 21,
    "chapter": 6,
    "text": "一个普通的人，",
    "start": 152.965,
    "end": 154.32999999999998,
    "style": "Narration"
  },
  {
    "segment": 21,
    "chapter": 6,
    "text": "也能通过学习、借助外物，",
    "start": 154.355,
    "end": 157.195,
    "style": "Narration"
  },
  {
    "segment": 21,
    "chapter": 6,
    "text": "做到从前做不到的事。",
    "start": 157.29,
    "end": 158.975,
    "style": "Narration"
  },
  {
    "segment": 22,
    "chapter": 6,
    "text": "从前，人借舟楫渡过江河。",
    "start": 160.565,
    "end": 164.345,
    "style": "Narration"
  },
  {
    "segment": 22,
    "chapter": 6,
    "text": "今天，我也可以借 AI 接触更多知识，",
    "start": 164.71,
    "end": 168.845,
    "style": "Narration"
  },
  {
    "segment": 22,
    "chapter": 6,
    "text": "尝试更多想法。",
    "start": 168.965,
    "end": 170.175,
    "style": "Narration"
  },
  {
    "segment": 22,
    "chapter": 6,
    "text": "工具让更多事情成为可能，",
    "start": 171.055,
    "end": 173.825,
    "style": "Narration"
  },
  {
    "segment": 22,
    "chapter": 6,
    "text": "学习让我把这些帮助，",
    "start": 174.13,
    "end": 176.59,
    "style": "Narration"
  },
  {
    "segment": 22,
    "chapter": 6,
    "text": "一点点变成自己的本领。",
    "start": 176.615,
    "end": 178.415,
    "style": "Narration"
  },
  {
    "segment": 23,
    "chapter": 6,
    "text": "所以，我还要学着提出自己的问题，",
    "start": 179.845,
    "end": 183.635,
    "style": "Narration"
  },
  {
    "segment": 23,
    "chapter": 6,
    "text": "分辨不同的解释，",
    "start": 183.875,
    "end": 185.885,
    "style": "Narration"
  },
  {
    "segment": 23,
    "chapter": 6,
    "text": "把想法真正做出来。",
    "start": 185.995,
    "end": 188.325,
    "style": "Narration"
  },
  {
    "segment": 23,
    "chapter": 6,
    "text": "一次次尝试，一点点积累，",
    "start": 188.755,
    "end": 191.915,
    "style": "Narration"
  },
  {
    "segment": 23,
    "chapter": 6,
    "text": "我也能超越今天的自己。",
    "start": 192.315,
    "end": 194.615,
    "style": "Narration"
  },
  {
    "segment": 24,
    "chapter": 6,
    "text": "“善假于物”，也要“学不可以已”。",
    "start": 195.735,
    "end": 200.155,
    "style": "Narration"
  },
  {
    "segment": 25,
    "chapter": 6,
    "text": "我想借今天的舟楫，",
    "start": 201.035,
    "end": 203.335,
    "style": "Narration"
  },
  {
    "segment": 25,
    "chapter": 6,
    "text": "去抵达昨天还到不了的地方。",
    "start": 203.465,
    "end": 205.995,
    "style": "Narration"
  }
]